### Create Milk Product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "MILK-001",
  "barcode": "0123456789012",
  "name": "Whole Milk 2L",
  "brand": "SmartMart",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "unitOfMeasure": "EACH",
  "sellingPrice": 5.49,
  "taxable": false,
  "perishable": true,
  "shelfLifeDays": 14
}

### Create Apple Product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "FRUIT-001",
  "barcode": "0123456789013",
  "name": "Gala Apples",
  "brand": "Fresh Produce",
  "categoryId": 2,
  "unitOfMeasure": "KG",
  "sellingPrice": 4.99,
  "taxable": false,
  "perishable": true,
  "shelfLifeDays": 10
}

### Get All Products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products

### Get Product By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1

### Search Products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/search?name=milk

### Get Products By Category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/category/1

### Update Product
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "MILK-001",
  "barcode": "0123456789012",
  "name": "Whole Milk 2L Updated",
  "brand": "SmartMart",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "unitOfMeasure": "EACH",
  "sellingPrice": 5.79,
  "taxable": false,
  "perishable": true,
  "shelfLifeDays": 14
}

### Deactivate Product
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "active": false
}

### Duplicate SKU Test
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "MILK-001",
  "barcode": "9999999999999",
  "name": "Duplicate Milk",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "unitOfMeasure": "EACH",
  "sellingPrice": 4.99,
  "taxable": false,
  "perishable": true
}